{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/pulls/71","id":4948919525,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUJ8YLs8AAAABJvqE5Q","html_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/packages/pull/71","diff_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/packages/pull/71.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/packages/pull/71.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/issues/71","number":71,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Prepare separate stable bootstrap packages without publication","user":{"login":"tangtaoit","id":3895878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTU4Nzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3895878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit","html_url":"https://github.com/tangtaoit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Stable public certificates are registered, but the bootstrap builder only emits preview packages with shared names and owned files. Add an explicit `--channel stable --control-root` preparation mode that reuses reviewed public roles and existing certificate validation, builds separate `wukongim-archive-keyring-stable` / `wukongim-release-stable` packages, and returns an unpublished preparation schema rejected by current preview publication consumers. Stable RPM configuration uses the planned mirrorlist endpoint without a floating baseurl fallback.\n\nThe existing preview layout, `/repo`, manifests, signer, composer, audit/client gates and production workflows remain unchanged. This does not enable stable, sign packages, access private keys, upload or publish anything. The native TEST ONLY workflow gains six real build/coinstallation cases; native `--root` installation uses a network-disabled, read-only container with root plus only `SYS_CHROOT`, scratch package databases and public inputs. It does not disable dependency, file-conflict or signature checks.\n\nValidation completed on first-attempt CI for `fb62e03bb8ceaf300610becdc1f23ff41558c675` (synthetic checkout has the identical tree):\n\n- [Pages](https://github.com/WuKongIM/packages/actions/runs/39572187767): 410 Python tests and four workflow contracts passed with zero skips; all publication steps/jobs skipped.\n- [Native](https://github.com/WuKongIM/packages/actions/runs/39572188094): seven metadata, ten local-signing and six new bootstrap cases all passed, followed by the complete trusted-tool signed-repository drill and tracked-tree check. Both channels build reproducibly, and real dpkg/rpm scratch installs pass in both orders with reinstalls; scratch cleanup is confirmed.\n- All three small JSON artifact ZIP SHA-256 values match the API and all member CRC/SHA checks pass. Bootstrap outputs remain unsigned, unpublished preparations; production signing, stable composition/audit, live mirrorlist/CDN behavior and public exact-version client acceptance remain separate gates.\n","created_at":"2026-10-21T08:49:26Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T08:58:24Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"915097dc67fffda99da2fac55f7def27e08e8c29","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"No8blackball","id":17797708,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Nzk3NzA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17797708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball","html_url":"https://github.com/No8blackball","followers_url":"https:/